# Motion

Follow [`DESIGN-MOTION.md`](DESIGN-MOTION.md) before writing any animation.

## Decide first

- 100+/day or keyboard-initiated → no motion
- Tens/day (nav, list hover) → color only, short, or none
- Occasional (drawers, dialogs, toasts) → standard motion
- Purpose must be spatial consistency, state, explanation, feedback, or avoiding a jump

## Tokens (`src/app/globals.css`)

Use these; do not invent new curves or durations.

- `--ease-out` enter/exit, `--ease-in-out` on-screen moves, `--ease` hover/color, `--ease-drawer` drawers
- Never `ease-in`. Never `transition: all`. Animate `transform` and `opacity` only.
- Press: `scale(0.97)` in `--duration-press`. Enter from `scale(0.95)` + `opacity: 0`, never `scale(0)`.
- UI under 300ms. Drawers/modals `--duration-drawer` / `--duration-dialog` (200–280ms).
- Hover behind `@media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine)`.
- Reduced motion: keep opacity/color, drop movement.

## Surfaces in this app

- Drawer: `translateX(100%)` → `0`, `--ease-drawer`, interruptible CSS transition
- Dialog: `scale(0.96)` + opacity, `--ease-out`, origin center
- Toast: `translateY(100%)` + opacity, CSS transition (not keyframes)
